# | ENTES EPC-12 Data Logger / Pulse Counter (Modbus RTU RS-485)
# | 
# | Source: entes-epc-12-modbus-register-table-tr.pdf
# | Protocol: Modbus RTU; FC03 read holding registers, FC06/16 write
# | All addresses are 0-based decimal.
# | Total counter registers (addr 0-47): 64-bit unsigned (4 regs each); only low u32 at base listed.
# | High u32 word is at base+2 (e.g. IN1 high word at addr 2).
# | Tariff counters (addr 48-239): 8 tariffs × 12 inputs, each u32 (2 regs).
# | Tariff time schedule tables (addr 32848-32959) not listed; see datasheet.
